          "file": ".github/workflows/compact.yml",
          "line": 8,
          "message": ".github/workflows/compact.yml:8: job `a` step 1 pins host port `5432` in `5432:5432`. Hosted and shared runners collide when a publish mapping fixes the host port. Publish a Docker-allocated port (`127.0.0.1::5432`, `::5432`, `0:5432`, or the container port only). A variable host port is not judged.",
          "rule": "github-actions-docker-host-ports",
          "target": "a"
        }
      ],
      "warnings": []
    }
  },
