          "line": 8,
          "message": ".github/workflows/compact.yml:8: job `a` step 1 downloads `https://example.invalid/compact.tgz` with `curl` and does not verify the bytes in this step. An http(s) download can change between runs. Verify it here with `sha256sum -c` or `shasum -a 256 -c` against a downloaded checksum file, use a trusted host, or add `# integrity-check: skip reason=<slug>`.",
          "rule": "github-actions-download-integrity",
